{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>and the friend of his pasture.</b> As its Targum: וסיע׳ מרחמוהי — a company of his friends. And some explain: the name of a man. And so the Masorah proves, that it was transmitted regarding him: there is no other person. מרעהו means his friend, and the mem in it is a root-letter, as in ויתנה למרעהו, and likewise מרעהו with Samson."], :book "genesis", :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :es, :chapter 26, :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:25:47.206164750Z", :translated-from :en, :model "glm-5.2"}